Source snapshot: sankofa-media/sankofa as of November 20, 2026.

src/engine/calm.ts is copied from Sankofa's features/engine/calm.ts.
src/engine/scroll.ts adapts ahead-loading and scene progress from scroll.ts.
src/engine/layers.ts and ink.ts adapt the layered plate/figure and pointer-depth
contracts. src/render.ts and model.ts adapt Kit/host scene and bilingual block
contracts. scripts/build-content.ts adapts the YAML feature and responsive-media
pipeline; scripts/seo.ts adapts the prerendered head and discovery-file pipeline.
Museum-specific player, clap, dictionary, and routing dependencies are omitted.

Research and editorial content originate in the adjacent Bull in the Heather
project. Source URLs and titles are preserved with each content block.
